   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Persistance**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Tetrachromacy**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Head On / Pill**: back after 26 archived shows (1007 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2022-05-26** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 118 min [1]. Said about its sound: Right channel boosted 3dB in Logic Pro; file converted to 44.1/16 FLAC [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recorder positioned center stage, approximately 75 feet from the performance area [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2022-05-26**: taped by Evan Gorski; source: AKG P170 (pair) -> UMC204HD [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG P170 mics into a UMC204HD, then Raspberry Pi 3B [1]",
